### Log in as a flight planner
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/air-freight/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=air-freight-api&username=t_flight_planner&password=t_password&scope=openid

> {% client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Log in as a load planner
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/air-freight/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=air-freight-api&username=t_load_planner&password=t_password&scope=openid

> {% client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Log in as an admin
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/air-freight/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=air-freight-api&username=t_admin&password=t_password&scope=openid

> {% client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Today's flights
GET http://localhost:8080/api/flights
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Simulate a schedule (admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simulator/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{"flightNumber": "HJ221", "departureAirport": "BRU", "arrivalAirport": "ATH", "aircraftRegistration": "SXBAA",
  "firstDate": "2026-11-02", "lastDate": "2026-11-08", "weekdays": ["MONDAY", "WEDNESDAY", "FRIDAY"],
  "departureTime": "06:30", "arrivalTime": "10:00"}]

### Register a delay (flight planner)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/flights/HJ221/2026-11-02/BRU/delays
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"side": "DEPARTURE", "minutes": 20, "delayCode": "93", "description": "Late inbound aircraft"}

### Read the flight policy
GET http://localhost:8080/api/policy-settings/flights
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Change the flight policy (admin)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/policy-settings/flights
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"actualTimeToleranceMinutes": 5, "retentionDays": 7}

### Read the loading policy
GET http://localhost:8080/api/policy-settings/loading
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Change the loading policy (admin)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/policy-settings/loading
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"windowOpensHoursBeforeStd": 12, "windowClosesMinutesBeforeEtd": 20, "maxLateralDifferencePercent": 10, "offloadingCheck": "HARD"}
